DTEND;TZID=Pacific/Auckland:20260101T193600
SUMMARY:Swim window - high tide at 18:06, 3.1m
DESCRIPTION:High tide at 18:06 (3.1m). Tide is flooding (rising) into the peak, then ebbing (falling) afterwards. Window is 90 min either side of peak high tide at Kohimarama Beach, Auckland. Included based on day-of-week start time and sunset+30min cutoff. Tide source: LINZ Auckland standard port predictions (not an official tide table).
LOCATION:Kohimarama Beach, Auckland
END:VEVENT
